<item><title>Gabon food agency warns of rising prices and unsafe food</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ga/gabon-food-agency-warns-of-rising-prices-and-unsafe-food-46e27b/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ga/gabon-food-agency-warns-of-rising-prices-and-unsafe-food-46e27b/</guid><category>Gabon</category><description>The agency says inspections have been interrupted as mixed control brigades await full deployment, while hygiene conditions have worsened.</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 11:16:11 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/ga/gabon-food-agency-warns-of-rising-prices-and-unsafe-food-46e27b/share.jpg" length="39721" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/ga/gabon-food-agency-warns-of-rising-prices-and-unsafe-food-46e27b/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Gabon backs commodity fund plan to expand local processing</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ga/gabon-backs-commodity-fund-plan-to-expand-local-processing-b6d55d/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ga/gabon-backs-commodity-fund-plan-to-expand-local-processing-b6d55d/</guid><category>Gabon</category><description>At a 17 November meeting in The Hague, Gabon endorsed the fund’s 2025-2035 strategy and sought technical support for agricultural and agro-industrial businesses.</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 09:54:51 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ga.jpg" length="31200" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ga.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
